{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787357221052433696,"compiled_state":{"alias":"nitro-zombie-mealworm","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"d242bda248135cb7c6bf00891e00477c54fa75352c0ee127913649e718fe045a","event_uuid":"78b5857c-ed2b-4251-98f1-a3253a087b1e","position":{"commit_sha":"d8f65faf6c6e1562d81a926ca0a2584a4567ffef","position":"1787354707836151001-78b5857c-ed2b-4251-98f1-a3253a087b1e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"9df597384ad64e1da8860888f0ef91d4f362675a34b506371eb3688679cf66e3","event_uuid":"cafe34cf-d7a5-49ae-a86b-856b231c3179","position":{"commit_sha":"a50f54e788b7d17ee56a2465fe3e8a851eaa04e0","position":"1787354714012637001-cafe34cf-d7a5-49ae-a86b-856b231c3179"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"df848c32018223deb2a40659486d5902f54d558aae33c027a125f6c8e81fe93a","event_uuid":"0e604b0b-62c2-44d7-b9b7-18d467b94ddc","position":{"commit_sha":"2cc68387c9c5b0b2b9338960b8af3563da54f7ab","position":"1787354721319188001-0e604b0b-62c2-44d7-b9b7-18d467b94ddc"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787354707836151001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"0e604b0b-62c2-44d7-b9b7-18d467b94ddc","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"e75e-0740-4642-434f"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nREVIEW_RESULT sidecars are keyed `(change_id, revision)` (`src/rebar/llm/code_review/sidecar.py:38-58`). A finding that the reviewer emits on one patchset and does not repeat on the next simply disappears: on Gerrit change 1867 the advisory naming the exact defect (`tapestried-abhorrent-tuna`) appeared on patchsets 1–2, was absent on 3–4, and the change merged unchanged. Recall per run is non-deterministic, so a finding's lifetime is currently one revision. Approved in the fortnight defect review (2026-08-21).\n\n## Approach\nWhen `finalize.py` assembles a review for revision N, load revision N-1's sidecar (same `change_id`), take its findings whose disposition is neither `addressed` nor `withdrawn`, and hand them to the Pass-2 verifier as standing items against the new diff. The verifier records each as `still-present`, `addressed` (diff changed the cited lines and the condition no longer holds), or `withdrawn` (re-grounding fails). Standing items keep their criterion and posture — an advisory stays advisory — so no new blocks arise from carry-forward alone. Persist the disposition in the new sidecar so the chain is auditable.\n\n## Scope\n`src/rebar/llm/code_review/sidecar.py`, `src/rebar/llm/code_review/finalize.py`, `src/rebar/llm/code_review/workflow_ops.py`, `src/rebar/llm/reviewers/code-review-verifier.md` (standing-item instructions), `src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py` (publish carried findings with their origin revision), `tests/unit/llm/code_review/test_finding_carry_forward.py` (new).\n\n## Testing\nHappy path: a finding on revision 1 not re-emitted on revision 2 is presented to the verifier and recorded `still-present`. Edge: the cited lines are deleted on revision 2 → `addressed`; revision 1 has no sidecar (first review) → no standing items; a rebase-only revision keeps all items. Pinning: `tests/unit/llm/code_review/test_sidecar*.py`, `tests/unit/test_review_bot.py` pass unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A finding present on revision N-1 and absent from the fresh Pass-1 output on revision N appears in revision N's sidecar with a disposition; checked by the new unit test.\n- [ ] Carry-forward never raises a finding's posture; checked by a test asserting blocking/advisory is unchanged across revisions.\n- [ ] Gerrit messages show carried findings with \"since patchset k\"; checked by the review-bot adapter test.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/code_review/sidecar.py","reason":"approved remediation edit"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/code_review/finalize.py","reason":"approved remediation edit"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/code_review/workflow_ops.py","reason":"approved remediation edit"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/reviewers/code-review-verifier.md","reason":"approved remediation edit"},{"path":"src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py","reason":"approved remediation edit"},{"path":"tests/unit/llm/code_review/test_finding_carry_forward.py","reason":"approved remediation edit"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a"],["relates_to","e75e-0740-4642-434f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["gates","fortnight-review"],"ticket_id":"7f54-9ef2-356a-4551","ticket_type":"story","title":"Carry unresolved code-review findings forward across patchsets","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["78b5857c-ed2b-4251-98f1-a3253a087b1e","cafe34cf-d7a5-49ae-a86b-856b231c3179","0e604b0b-62c2-44d7-b9b7-18d467b94ddc"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787357221052433696,"uuid":"fa10d7e5-b6c1-435d-bc13-2d7f19ef6293"}